{
  "name": "Marketing — Social Publisher (Instagram + Facebook)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Social publisher (Instagram + Facebook)\nContent calendar = `SocialPosts` sheet. Every 30 min, up to 3 rows with `status=approved` and `publish_at` due are locked and published.\n\n- `platforms`: `instagram`, `facebook` or `instagram,facebook`\n- `format`: `image` | `reel` | `text` (text = Facebook only)\n- `media_url`: **public** HTTPS URL (Instagram fetches it). For Drive, use a CDN or public link.\n- `caption` empty → Claude writes platform-specific captions from `brief` + `BusinessConfig`. Filled → used verbatim.\n\nInstagram uses **Instagram API with Instagram Login** (`IG_USER_ID`, `IG_ACCESS_TOKEN`, long-lived 60 days — refresh monthly). Facebook uses a Page token (`FB_PAGE_ID`, `FB_PAGE_TOKEN`).\nFailures → `status=failed|partially_posted`, `error` filled, manager alerted on WhatsApp.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "0532d5e5-386f-4bf8-91b4-1337ed36345b",
